        "title": "The Future of Learning: AI Tutors and Personalization",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "AI is expanding the tools available for teaching and learning -- intelligent tutors, generative AI writing assistants, automated feedback systems, adaptive content generation. The question is not whether AI will affect education; it already does. The harder question is which functions it can genuinely improve, which functions require human judgment and relationship, and which institutional decisions should not be automated merely because they can be predicted."
